  m_text: 'After a long journey through the garden, the curious monarch butterfly
    finally gathered all three fragments of the Nectar Bloom Heart and brought them
    together once more.


    With the Nectar Bloom Heart fully restored, its magic
    has spread throughout the garden once again, returning the flowers to their natural
    rhythms and bringing back its lost harmony.


    The garden was flourishing
    once again, with the flowers'' petals dancing in the moonlight as the butterfly
    fluttered amongst them.


    This simple little detour has blossomed into an
    unforgettable adventure. With the garden finally at peace, the little monarch
    butterfly spread its wings and continued on its way, leaving behind a garden
    reborn.


    Sometimes, the smallest wings can make the biggest difference.


    Thank
    you for playing!'
